Hi there!

In this weekly progress update we'd like to share with you the latest news of the game development.


 Added flag for the helper to enable/disable via script;
 Added mechanism of smashing beasts by pushing the wagon;
 Added refactor stories output, skipping text and slides;
 Changed alpha of blur layer for deep undergrounds;
 Added simplify of anger and HP mods logic.


And a few new NPCs added:

 NPC Cactus ghost that scares enemies;
 Padre NPC char;
 NPC Splinter + Pixel art update;
 NPC Survivor;


Thank you for staying, see you in the next update!

Yours,
Flippin Kaktus Dev. Team

